{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Group - Privilege - Administrator Privileges Assigned to an Okta Group",
	"Description": "An administrator role was granted to an Okta group. Granting at the group level is quieter than granting to a user, because the adversary can then add themselves to the group and inherit the role without another privilege event.\n\nEvent type: group.privilege.grant\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/persistence_administrator_privileges_assigned_to_okta_group/\n- https://github.com/elastic/detection-rules/tree/main/rules/integrations/okta/persistence_administrator_privileges_assigned_to_okta_group.toml",
